# Repo Readiness Checklist — Per-Repo Standards

SSOT: `unified-trading-pm/docs/REPO_READINESS_CHECKLIST.md`
Master tracker: `unified-trading-pm/plans/archive/code_readiness_master_plan_2026_03_11.plan.md`
